  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Associated skill 5 ranks, Performance sphere ((lyric) package).</p>\n<p>Whenever you would use an inspiring lyric, you can choose to make it an invigorating lyric, healing the target 1d12 hit points. When an invigorating lyric is expended, the target heals an additional 1d12 hit points, plus 1d12 per 4 ranks in this package’s associated Perform skill you possess. A creature can only be targeted by your invigorating lyric a number of times per day equal to your operative ability modifier (minimum 1).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/performance#toc62\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
